{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t美國一名陸軍中將涉嫌向傳媒洩密被解職。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n美國傳媒指，美國陸軍負責戰略規劃的高級將領西維亞涉嫌對傳媒洩漏有關伊朗戰爭和俄烏衝突的內部資料，在三次測謊中未能通過。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n美國總統特朗普被問到事件時說，正在全力尋找洩密者，指西維亞將面臨巨大和長期的問題。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T02:21:54.211551+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T01:46:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:39:47.586992+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T02:18:28.101727+00:00","content_hash":"57a4c99ab4b9236eb79cd21440fd2fa2a362f61b37eb29cc9c4de495e7b8a01b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}